cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenBench in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenBench: The Open Source Agentic AI Workbench"
abstract: >-
  OpenBench is an open-source Python SDK for composable AI workflows. It acts as
  a workflow orchestrator, agent runtime, and universal control plane for AI,
  letting developers compose data sources, agents, and output generators with
  chainable operators across multiple frameworks.
type: software
authors:
